"Vill-ma is an Artonan executioner living in a sand-layered mansion outside a desert city."
"She is young, with a prominent forehead and dark pink eyes, in burgundy and black robes."
"Her black executioner's ring, marked with the logogram for death, has severed one head."
"She has a young son learning to read, and follows Ro-den's downfall avidly."
"She judged Olget-ovekondo's wand crime and tried to recruit Stuart as an investigator."
